developing now to what it is.

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:18.180
I'm looking, I was just chatting with Sam,

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:22.110
who was one of our first
Special Operations students here

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:24.660
as a late career Yale College student,

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:27.210
and helped found this
Special Operations conference

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:29.760
