00:05:02.310 --> 00:05:05.340
that you think might be of
relevance to this audience?

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:06.173
Thank you.

00:05:07.020 --> 00:05:07.860
- Thank you very much.

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:08.733
Thank you Ted.

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:11.100
Pardon the hoarseness of my voice.

00:05:11.100 --> 00:05:13.590
I sort of seem to have allergies.

00:05:13.590 --> 00:05:16.920
So thank you again for
