investing in this research area.

00:23:43.560 --> 00:23:48.240
So as long as they continue
that and are patient,

00:23:48.240 --> 00:23:50.320
I think this is going to lead to

00:23:51.870 --> 00:23:54.660
really interesting new technologies.

00:23:54.660 --> 00:23:58.653
Exactly in what form and what
the best use cases will be,

00:24:00.840 --> 00:24:03.420
that's the future of which
I'm still unsure about.

