business with the government

00:35:12.360 --> 00:35:13.500
but don't have a cage code,

00:35:13.500 --> 00:35:15.390
don't have a facility clearance.

00:35:15.390 --> 00:35:17.580
How do you get involved

00:35:17.580 --> 00:35:20.100
with working with the Pentagon or the IC?

00:35:20.100 --> 00:35:23.790
So, you know, there's many companies

00:35:23.790 --> 00:35:25.950
that are leading those initiatives

00:35:25.950 --> 00:35:29.250
and I have to say the Pentagon's
done a great job with DIU

00:35:29.250 --> 00:35:33.540
and establishing an office down
in the valley and everything

00:35:33.540 --> 00:35:36.180
which is moving the needle
but not fast enough.

00:35:36.180 --> 00:35:39.570
So we are actively looking at firms

00:35:39.570 --> 00:35:42.000
that can provide solutions,

00:35:42.000 --> 00:35:46.350
neat solutions to really sit on that

00:35:46.350 --> 00:35:51.120
overarching capability
set that is affecting us

00:35:51.120 --> 00:35:53.580
like near peer and all this
other stuff that's happening,

00:35:53.580 --> 00:35:57.990
but also the unexpected type
