00:36:35.010 --> 00:36:40.010
But this engagement is
also morphing as well

00:36:40.380 --> 00:36:44.760
where we're seeing so many threats evolve

00:36:44.760 --> 00:36:48.960
and the next generation,,

00:36:48.960 --> 00:36:51.030
or the current generation of operators

00:36:51.030 --> 00:36:54.360
