00:36:54.360 --> 00:36:59.340
They need to have core
capabilities, not expert level,

00:36:59.340 --> 00:37:03.990
but at least conversational
level at osen, at even human.

00:37:03.990 --> 00:37:07.290
I'm a human guy and I
think it's very important

00:37:07.290 --> 00:37:10.830
when you're out in the field,
if you're disconnected,

00:37:10.830 --> 00:37:14.670
you can still function and
sustain in that environment

00:37:14.670 --> 00:37:17.310
individually, and that is very crucial.

00:37:17.310 --> 00:37:20.340
That is something that I'm very pushing on

00:37:20.340 --> 00:37:22.680
with the folks down in Tampa and Bragg,

00:37:22.680 --> 00:37:27.680
