basic fundamentals as well.

00:37:49.200 --> 00:37:52.620
Human is key, I'm gonna
put a plug in for human

00:37:52.620 --> 00:37:57.000
just because we saw this
in the '90s and the '80s,

00:37:57.000 --> 00:37:58.950
just because as the '80s

00:37:58.950 --> 00:38:02.040
we were launching all these
satellites and everything.

00:38:02.040 --> 00:38:05.820
Hey no problem, we can see
anything from anywhere, great,

00:38:05.820 --> 00:38:08.730
but we could then tap
into the terror networks

00:38:08.730 --> 00:38:12.150
in Philippines, et cetera, in
Pakistan, Afghanistan areas.

00:38:12.150 --> 00:38:15.870
So we need to keep that capability alive,

00:38:15.870 --> 00:38:20.870
but at the same time we
need to increase and reduce

00:38:21.180 --> 00:38:23.220
this talent train that we're experiencing

00:38:23.220 --> 00:38:25.320
within the NASA community,

00:38:25.320 --> 00:38:28.650
that we need to recruit individuals

00:38:28.650 --> 00:38:30.660
and recruit the next generation,

00:38:30.660 --> 00:38:33.870
and not just talk about, okay,

00:38:33.870 --> 00:38:36.570
hey, we're gonna recruit from
these communities, et cetera,

00:38:36.570 --> 00:38:38.670
but also be competitive about it, right?

00:38:38.670 --> 00:38:40.950
And include, you know, there's a thing

00:38:40.950 --> 00:38:44.730
I give incentivize but also expedite,

00:38:44.730 --> 00:38:47.160
Facebook or Google gives an offer letter

