and you start Monday.

00:38:49.320 --> 00:38:52.080
Clearance level at the
NSA is gonna take a year,

00:38:52.080 --> 00:38:53.343
That kid is not waiting,

00:38:54.180 --> 00:38:56.910
they're not waiting and
we're losing individual,

00:38:56.910 --> 00:38:58.890
we're losing talent that way.

00:38:58.890 --> 00:39:00.630
And that is a big concern right now.

